        "Description": "This is a tricky one. Good evening, your targets are Agent Thames, Agent Swan, and Agent Lowenthal. Dalia Margolis&apos;s intel sent us here but Helmut Kruger&apos;s intel sent us to Colorado. Were going here first because we believe these three people know a secret base in Colorado. They must all be eliminated by accidents. Good luck.",
